 CBNuGridWin args;id;eventName;logMsg;currentLog;row;col;mouseFlag;newValue
⍝ Native ⎕WC equivalent of CBNuGrid — logs Grid events to the F1.Log label
⍝ args is flattened: id eventName info[1] info[2] info[3] ...

 id←⊃args
 eventName←2⊃args

⍝ Format the event message based on event type
 :Select eventName
 :Case 'CellMove'
     ⍝ Info: [row, col, scrollFlag, selectionFlag, mouseFlag, changedFlag, newValue]
     row←3⊃args
     col←4⊃args
     mouseFlag←7⊃args
     logMsg←'CellMove: Row ',(⍕row),' Col ',(⍕col),(mouseFlag=0)/' (kbd)'
     logMsg,←(mouseFlag=1)/' (click)'
 :Case 'CellChanged'
     ⍝ Info: [row, col, newValue]
     row←3⊃args
     col←4⊃args
     newValue←5⊃args
     logMsg←'CellChanged: [',(⍕row),',',(⍕col),'] = ',⍕newValue
 :Case 'KeyPress'
     ⍝ Info: [key, charCode, keyCode, shiftState]
     logMsg←'KeyPress: "',(⍕3⊃args),'" shift=',⍕6⊃args
 :CaseList 'MouseDown' 'MouseUp' 'MouseDblClick'
     ⍝ Info: [y, x, button, shiftState]
     logMsg←eventName,': Y=',(⍕3⊃args),' X=',(⍕4⊃args),' Btn=',⍕5⊃args
 :Case 'MouseEnter'
     logMsg←'MouseEnter'
 :Case 'MouseLeave'
     logMsg←'MouseLeave'
 :Else
     logMsg←eventName,': ',⍕2↓args
 :EndSelect

⍝ Update the event log label (prepend new event)
 currentLog←'F1.Log'⎕WG'Caption'
 'F1.Log'⎕WS'Caption'(logMsg,(⎕UCS 10),currentLog)
